# What Vercel does not need, and must not upload.
#
# Vercel does not read .gitignore, so without this it packs the whole working
# directory: a deploy tried to upload 984MB and was refused for exceeding the
# 100MB file limit. The built installers under desktop/ are the bulk of it —
# they are attached to the GitHub release, not served from here.
#
# Vercel builds the site itself from source, so node_modules and dist are its
# own to produce rather than ours to send.

node_modules
dist

# The Electron shell and its built installers. The desktop app loads the
# deployed site over the network; none of this is served.
desktop

# Database scripts and migrations, run against Supabase rather than deployed.
supabase
*.sql

# Docs and local tooling.
docs
.claude
.github
